-- Gives the weapons and equipment of mixed-tech units V3_8 loaded their own tech (importers skill, bugs
-- 11 and 26). Until 2026-11-01 the importer gave every weapon of one name in one mech location the tech
-- of the first IS / Clan slot naming it (the Kodiak (Cale)'s 3 Clan and 2 IS ER medium lasers were all
-- Clan), matched slots by spelling only (missing "ISBPod" for "Anti-BattleArmor Pods (B-Pods)"), and gave
-- unprefixed items on mixed-tech units the chassis tech (an IS-only Heavy PPC on a Clan chassis was Clan).
--
-- Generated from a database V3_8 and V3_9 loaded and the fixed importer then re-imported (mechs, then
-- vehicles, mm-data at d195e171b3c87801c8dbc5ffcb5f763e5da57483), by comparing each unit's items before
-- and after: only tech changed, 220 items on 103 units. A row is picked by its unit and attributes, and
-- equipment by name and tech, so this also runs on a database that was re-imported since V3_8.
-- "id = ANY (ARRAY(...))" runs each row lookup once: right after V3_8 the tables have no statistics, and
-- "id IN (...)" was planned as a lookup per row (minutes per statement).
-- Data migrations after V3_8 update what's stored; see the importers skill.

-- 1. The IS / Clan versions no unit had before
